## Summary

Identifies and eliminates six duplicated code patterns across the codebase by extracting shared utilities and UI primitives.

### New shared utilities

**`createSafeContext<T>(hookName, providerName)`** (`src/utils/`) — factory that returns a `[Context, useSafeContext]` tuple, replacing the repeated `createContext<T | null>(null)` + `useContext` + null-guard-throw pattern used by both `useCart` and `useNotificationsActor`:

```ts
// before (repeated in useCart.ts and NotificationCenter.utils.ts)
const Ctx = createContext<T | null>(null)
function useX() {
  const v = useContext(Ctx)
  if (!v) throw new Error(...)
  return v
}

// after
const [Ctx, useX] = createSafeContext<T>('useX', 'Provider')
```

**`selectUnreadCount`** (`NotificationCenter.utils`) — shared selector extracted from identical inline lambdas in `NotificationCenter` and `NotificationFilters`.

### New UI primitives

| Component | Deduplicates |
|-----------|-------------|
| `IconButton` + `iconButtonClass` | Identical 100-char icon-button class string in `AppLayout` (Link) and `NotificationBell` (button) |
| `EmptyState` | Centered heading + message + back-link pattern in `CartPage` and `ProductDetailPage` |
| `Card` + `cardSurfaceClass` | `rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900` repeated across `CartItem`, `CartSummary`, `ProductCard` |

**`NotificationBell`** now composes `IconButton` + `Badge` instead of hand-rolling its own badge markup (which duplicated `Badge`'s styling).

No behavioral changes — build and lint pass. 3 pre-existing test failures in `useCart.test.tsx` also fail on `main`.

Link to Devin session: https://app.devin.ai/sessions/c0cea72c195044cfa8153d424d3de352
